The [[Potion Belt]] is a legendary [[Bag]] available in the shop for all classes. It has four spaces arranged in a line, and has synergies related to [[Potion]]s. The first time a [[Potion]] inside is consumed, a random buff is gained. If four [[Potion]]s inside are consumed, many debuffs are cleansed.

Getting the single [[Potion]] buff is fairly trivial, but consuming four [[Potion]]s requires a bit of planning. Each of the four [[Potion]]s would need to be halfway in the bag, and the entire setup should be vertical to make the most of the [[Potion]] spillover. Also the particular [[Potion]]s would need to be likely to meet their consume condition, which isn't always guaranteed. Relying entirely on [[Potion]]s that trigger too quickly, like [[Stone Skin Potion]]s, also isn't advised, as there likely wouldn't be enough debuffs to cleanse yet. Ideally, two [[Potion Belt]]s side-by-side can be used to double up on the effect.

